WEBVTT

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:12.320
<b>My Next Life as a Villainess:
All Routes Lead to Doom!</b>

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:35.530
<b>Episode 11 
The Moment of My Doom Arrived... Part 2</b>

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:41.910
I swear...

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:46.680
How long are you going to 
keep sleeping, you fool?!

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:48.210
Wh... What?

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:50.110
Don't "What?" me!

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:52.200
I called you a dozen times, 
and you didn't wake up.

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:54.670
You're going to be late to school again.

00:01:54.670 --> 00:01:56.920
Huh? Mother?

00:01:56.920 --> 00:01:58.820
"Mother"?

00:01:58.820 --> 00:01:59.700
Uh, wha...

00:01:59.700 --> 00:02:02.390
Come on, snap out of it 
and get ready for school!

00:02:02.730 --> 00:02:05.000
And make sure you fix your hair!

00:02:07.970 --> 00:02:11.990
Isn't there anything I can do 
about these cowlicks?

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:15.310
Anne usually makes my 
hair look nice for me...

00:02:15.510 --> 00:02:18.620
Huh? Wait, who is Anne?

00:02:21.800 --> 00:02:24.940
Is this what I've always looked like?

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:28.120
Oh, crap!

00:02:31.020 --> 00:02:35.800
When are you going to learn to wake up 
without having your blanket yanked off of you?

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:37.950
Shouldn't you be at college, Onii-chan?

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:39.840
My classes start in the afternoon.

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:41.360
Here's your lunch.

00:02:41.360 --> 00:02:42.670
Thanks!

00:02:42.670 --> 00:02:44.450
Okay, now get going.

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:46.760
Right! See you later!

00:02:46.830 --> 00:02:49.260
Wait! Why did you take <i>that</i>?!

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:54.580
If you have to eat on the run, 
at least take bread or something!

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:55.860
Have a good day.

00:02:59.310 --> 00:03:01.150
Just barely safe!

00:03:01.380 --> 00:03:03.380
Nope, sorry. You're out.

00:03:08.570 --> 00:03:13.010
Someone in my class told me you 
got called out for coming in late.

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:16.010
Yeah, I was up a little too late last night.

00:03:16.010 --> 00:03:17.730
I had trouble getting up this morning.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:20.660
You were playing games all 
night again, weren't you?

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:25.340
You should try to manage your time better.

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:28.420
So, how far have you 
gotten in <i>Fortune Lover</i>?

00:03:28.670 --> 00:03:32.110
I'm about to conquer 
the self-centered Prince Alan.

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:35.210
But I've been able to talk normally 
with him and enjoy it,

00:03:35.210 --> 00:03:38.450
so he doesn't really 
seem that self-centered.

00:03:38.630 --> 00:03:40.400
He's generally pretty nice.

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:41.860
Nice?

00:03:41.860 --> 00:03:45.550
Wait... huh? What am I talking about?

00:03:45.550 --> 00:03:48.980
Uh, n-never mind! 
We should hurry up and eat!

00:03:48.980 --> 00:03:51.630
I missed breakfast, so I'm really hungry.

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:53.870
You can have my rolled omelet, then.

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:57.810
Thanks, Acchan-sama! I'll eat it right now!

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:01.790
So good!

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:10.140
<i>The usual routine...</i>

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:12.980
<i>Every day is the same as always...</i>

00:04:15.230 --> 00:04:19.010
<i>Yet for some reason, it all feels so nostalgic</i>

00:04:19.520 --> 00:04:20.990
<i>and precious.</i>

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:27.970
<i>Still...</i>

00:04:27.970 --> 00:04:33.000
<i>I feel as if I'm forgetting 
something important...</i>

00:04:43.550 --> 00:04:46.120
She's been asleep for two whole days.

00:04:46.120 --> 00:04:48.020
And we don't even know why!

00:04:48.340 --> 00:04:52.040
This latest doctor is the most intelligent 
and advanced one in the country.

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:54.640
I'm sure he'll figure out what's going on.

00:05:03.890 --> 00:05:06.220
Everyone, please come in.

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:09.540
What do you think?

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:13.190
Frankly, I have no idea what's causing this.

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:16.900
I've examined her all over, 
and nothing is physically wrong.

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:19.000
She may wake up at any moment,

00:05:19.310 --> 00:05:22.110
or she may never wake up again.

00:05:23.330 --> 00:05:24.740
Oh, no!

00:05:27.150 --> 00:05:31.440
What will happen to her 
if she never wakes up?

00:05:31.780 --> 00:05:34.850
If she just continues to sleep 
for the rest of her life,

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:38.810
I suppose she'll grow weaker 
and eventually die.

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:41.440
No! You can't be serious!

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:42.400
Master Keith!

00:06:01.520 --> 00:06:02.980
Lady Catarina...

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:22.810
<i>Lady Catarina, please... please...</i>

00:06:22.810 --> 00:06:25.150
<i>Please don't leave me...</i>

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:32.740
Are you all right?

00:06:34.790 --> 00:06:37.400
Yes... I'm sorry.

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:38.990
I'll go and do the cleaning.

00:06:38.990 --> 00:06:40.340
Of course.

00:06:40.340 --> 00:06:42.760
I'll keep an eye on Catarina.

00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:44.020
Thank you.

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.020
Catarina...

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:59.010
Besides, this is just a scratch. 
It's nothing to worry about.

00:06:59.520 --> 00:07:02.670
<i>When that strange little 
girl came into my life,</i>

00:07:03.220 --> 00:07:05.730
<i>her bizarre behavior drew my interest.</i>

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:07.560
<i>And as I spent time with you,</i>

00:07:07.560 --> 00:07:09.450
<i>the dull, gray world I had been living in</i>

00:07:09.450 --> 00:07:11.280
<i>became filled with brilliant colors.</i>

00:07:12.400 --> 00:07:14.230
<i>Before that, all I ever knew was boredom,</i>

00:07:14.230 --> 00:07:16.990
<i>and everything felt tedious.</i>

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:25.760
<i>I knew nothing of happiness or pleasure,</i>

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:27.920
<i>and you taught all that to me.</i>

00:07:33.270 --> 00:07:35.300
<i>Jealousy and loneliness, too.</i>

00:07:35.300 --> 00:07:36.380
<i>Everything.</i>

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:43.020
<i>I knew danger was near,</i>

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:45.820
<i>and yet I couldn't protect you.</i>

00:08:12.180 --> 00:08:14.600
<i>We're brother and sister now.</i>

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:16.510
You can call me "Sister."

00:08:16.880 --> 00:08:19.260
<i>I remember it as if it was just yesterday.</i>

00:08:19.730 --> 00:08:21.470
<i>I was called a monster,</i>

00:08:21.710 --> 00:08:23.610
<i>sat huddled up in a dark room,</i>

00:08:23.800 --> 00:08:25.610
<i>and lived my life all alone.</i>

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:28.560
<i>And then she smiled at me.</i>

00:08:29.000 --> 00:08:30.270
<i>With her warm hand,</i>

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:33.860
<i>she led me into a much brighter world.</i>

00:08:37.520 --> 00:08:39.320
<i>That was when I made a vow</i>

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:43.080
<i>to become stronger so that 
I could be the one to protect her.</i>

00:08:46.300 --> 00:08:47.650
<i>And yet...</i>

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:51.780
<i>Why wasn't I by her side when she needed me?</i>

00:08:58.840 --> 00:09:02.980
<i>Your green thumb makes you extra special 
and extra amazing, Mary!</i>

00:09:03.350 --> 00:09:07.790
<i>I still clearly remember 
the day I met Lady Catarina.</i>

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:09.850
<i>I was a weakling and a coward,</i>

00:09:09.850 --> 00:09:12.570
<i>always looking down, always running away.</i>

00:09:12.570 --> 00:09:16.340
<i>But Lady Catarina said I was special...</i>

00:09:16.340 --> 00:09:18.990
<i>that I was amazing.</i>

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:23.490
<i>I am who I am now because 
Lady Catarina was by my side.</i>

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:28.240
<i>Because she loved me 
and said I was important.</i>

00:09:28.240 --> 00:09:32.050
<i>I hated myself, but she 
made me love who I was.</i>

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:35.170
<i>I want to continue to be with her forever.</i>

00:09:36.280 --> 00:09:38.910
<i>With the one I love, 
who's so precious to me...</i>

00:09:45.710 --> 00:09:48.610
<i>I'm sure you have some of each, as well.</i>

00:09:48.610 --> 00:09:51.690
We all have things we handle
well and things we don't.

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:54.540
<i>That's what she said to me when I was</i>

00:09:54.540 --> 00:09:57.740
<i>sulking over being constantly 
compared to my twin brother.</i>

00:09:57.740 --> 00:09:59.740
<i>She never held back when competing with me</i>

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:01.950
<i>and always faced me head-on.</i>

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:03.320
<i>After I met her,</i>

00:10:03.320 --> 00:10:07.580
<i>I was finally able to loosen the excess 
tension I'd been putting on my shoulders.</i>

00:10:12.890 --> 00:10:15.980
<i>Being next to someone as honest 
and straightforward as her</i>

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:17.810
<i>made me feel so comfortable.</i>

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:22.300
<i>So I stayed beside her, as if it was 
the most natural thing in the world.</i>

00:10:23.530 --> 00:10:26.810
<i>I'm scared of losing her!</i>

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:29.010
<i>How could I be so oblivious?</i>

00:10:29.300 --> 00:10:32.410
<i>Why did it take me until now 
to realize how I feel?!</i>

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:44.030
<i>With such lovely parents 
and such an adorable sister,</i>

00:10:44.030 --> 00:10:47.250
you truly are blessed, Master Nicol.

00:10:47.690 --> 00:10:51.240
<i>People decided that a precious 
member of my family was a jinx,</i>

00:10:51.240 --> 00:10:53.010
<i>and took pity on me.</i>

00:10:53.240 --> 00:10:57.680
<i>No matter how many times I told them 
I was happy, no one understood.</i>

00:10:58.090 --> 00:11:00.280
<i>I had decided that no one 
would ever understand,</i>

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:02.470
<i>that I should just give up.</i>

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:05.690
<i>But Catarina, and only Catarina, understood.</i>

00:11:05.950 --> 00:11:08.490
<i>When anger and frustration flooded my heart,</i>

00:11:08.490 --> 00:11:10.490
<i>she embraced it with her warmth.</i>

00:11:11.070 --> 00:11:14.690
<i>From that day on, 
Catarina was someone special to me.</i>

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:18.120
<i>But she's engaged to my childhood 
friend, the third prince.</i>

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:22.810
<i>I know I can't be with her forever, 
no matter how I feel about her.</i>

00:11:22.810 --> 00:11:26.080
<i>But still, I wanted to stay close 
to her as long as possible.</i>

00:11:27.310 --> 00:11:30.410
Don't go anywhere, Catarina.

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:39.330
<i>Your white hair is as beautiful as silk,</i>

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:42.180
and your red eyes twinkle like rubies.

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:44.050
I think they're both beautiful!

00:11:44.360 --> 00:11:45.780
<i>For my whole life,</i>

00:11:45.780 --> 00:11:49.400
<i>people called me "creepy" 
and "cursed" because of my looks.</i>

00:11:49.400 --> 00:11:52.020
<i>But Lady Catarina said I was pretty</i>

00:11:52.020 --> 00:11:54.310
<i>and asked me to be her friend.</i>

00:11:54.310 --> 00:11:56.440
<i>She was the first friend I ever had.</i>

00:11:56.680 --> 00:11:58.400
<i>Her smile was so kind...</i>

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:01.930
<i>My life then changed in a tremendous way.</i>

00:12:04.740 --> 00:12:07.570
<i>I left the room I had 
spent my life locked away in</i>

00:12:07.570 --> 00:12:09.770
<i>and stepped into the bright sun.</i>

00:12:09.770 --> 00:12:12.420
<i>I thought being so happy 
every day was like a dream</i>

00:12:12.420 --> 00:12:14.750
<i>that only ever happened in books,</i>

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.480
<i>but then I was living it.</i>

00:12:17.870 --> 00:12:19.200
<i>But now...</i>

00:12:20.350 --> 00:12:22.710
I don't want to lose Lady Catarina!

00:12:22.710 --> 00:12:25.100
I couldn't bear that!

00:12:25.100 --> 00:12:28.410
<i>That's right! I refuse to lose her again!</i>

00:12:35.010 --> 00:12:36.130
Who was that?

00:12:37.880 --> 00:12:40.040
<i>I finally managed to find her!</i>

00:12:40.040 --> 00:12:41.810
<i>I won't lose her again!</i>

00:12:42.840 --> 00:12:44.490
That voice...

00:12:51.400 --> 00:12:53.920
<i>I'm going to save her this time.</i>

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:56.700
<i>So don't just sit around in here crying.</i>

00:12:56.700 --> 00:12:59.250
<i>You have to take me to her!</i>

00:13:09.830 --> 00:13:13.600
I am Lady Catarina's best friend, Mary Hunt!

00:13:13.720 --> 00:13:16.840
I'm not a weakling like 
those other noble ladies!

00:13:18.840 --> 00:13:21.410
What am I doing, sitting around in here?

00:13:22.210 --> 00:13:24.700
I have to save my sister!

00:13:24.870 --> 00:13:27.280
She saved me.

00:13:27.280 --> 00:13:28.620
Now it's my turn.

00:13:37.580 --> 00:13:38.890
Miss Sophia?

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:43.080
I want to stay with Lady Catarina 
until she awakens!

00:13:43.290 --> 00:13:44.840
I'm staying with my sister, too!

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:47.720
I won't leave Lady Catarina's side, either!

00:13:48.070 --> 00:13:49.080
Me, neither.

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:51.520
I'll keep talking to her until she wakes up!

00:13:54.070 --> 00:13:55.120
Everyone...

00:13:59.570 --> 00:14:01.930
<i>Please, I beg you...</i>

00:14:01.930 --> 00:14:03.900
<i>Save Lady Catarina.</i>

00:14:04.210 --> 00:14:07.420
<i>I'm on it! I'll bring her back, I promise!</i>

00:14:07.420 --> 00:14:10.160
<i>All of you, just stay there 
and keep calling to her!</i>

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:40.770
Acchan, I'm finally here!

00:14:42.700 --> 00:14:43.880
Hey.

00:14:47.510 --> 00:14:51.170
I'm working on conquering the 
black-hearted, sadistic prince now.

00:14:51.170 --> 00:14:54.050
I can't seem to make any 
progress with him, though.

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:55.330
I see.

00:14:56.890 --> 00:14:59.920
So... how's school going? 
Are you having fun?

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:01.640
Huh? Yeah.

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:04.500
What brought that on, anyway?

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:11.690
I'm having a lot of fun.

00:15:12.830 --> 00:15:16.900
I'm glad I was able to find you again 
and spend time with you.

00:15:18.080 --> 00:15:22.570
But... this isn't your world anymore, is it?

00:15:23.410 --> 00:15:24.570
Acchan?

00:15:25.340 --> 00:15:28.100
Your world is somewhere else now.

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:32.070
There are a lot of people 
waiting for you there.

00:15:32.550 --> 00:15:35.840
Listen. They're all calling for you.

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:39.460
<i>Catarina! Catarina!</i>

00:15:39.760 --> 00:15:41.000
Please wake up!

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:44.210
I can't even imagine life 
without you anymore!

00:15:44.300 --> 00:15:45.980
Wake up, Sister!

00:15:45.980 --> 00:15:48.670
Didn't you promise you'd always be with me?!

00:15:48.670 --> 00:15:53.010
Lady Catarina, I can't do my best 
at anything without you!

00:15:53.120 --> 00:15:54.930
Are you just gonna sleep forever?!

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:56.840
Wake up already, you dumb rich girl!

00:15:57.140 --> 00:15:58.930
Wake up, Catarina!

00:15:59.020 --> 00:16:01.520
Please open your eyes, Lady Catarina!

00:16:01.610 --> 00:16:04.580
Please wake up, Lady Catarina!

00:16:09.270 --> 00:16:13.370
Why... did I forget?

00:16:14.580 --> 00:16:18.010
<i>My family can be annoying, 
but they're so kind.</i>

00:16:18.320 --> 00:16:21.860
<i>I have a close otaku friend 
and a beloved otome game...</i>

00:16:21.860 --> 00:16:24.830
<i>This world feels comfortable to be in.</i>

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:26.080
<i>But...</i>

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:28.610
I have to go back!

00:16:28.610 --> 00:16:31.550
To the world where all 
the people I love are waiting for me!

00:16:52.210 --> 00:16:53.840
That's it! Acchan!

00:16:53.840 --> 00:16:56.410
I bet you know where Maria is, right?

00:16:56.810 --> 00:16:59.010
Maria is on the school grounds.

00:16:59.010 --> 00:17:01.410
There's a hidden room 
in the school storehouse.

00:17:01.680 --> 00:17:04.310
Also, why did the student 
council president—

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:10.580
I know you can fix this.

00:17:10.580 --> 00:17:15.040
Save the president, 
just like you saved all of us.

00:17:15.560 --> 00:17:17.180
His real name is...

00:17:21.070 --> 00:17:22.360
Acchan!

00:17:22.360 --> 00:17:25.730
<i>This is probably the last 
time I'll ever see Acchan.</i>

00:17:26.130 --> 00:17:28.790
<i>My best friend ever since middle school...</i>

00:17:29.100 --> 00:17:31.490
<i>She's helped me out so much</i>

00:17:31.920 --> 00:17:33.500
<i>but because of that accident,</i>

00:17:33.500 --> 00:17:36.270
<i>I didn't have a chance 
to thank her or say goodbye.</i>

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:40.630
Acchan! I'm so glad I got to see you again!

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:42.190
Goodbye!

00:17:42.190 --> 00:17:44.160
Thank you so much for always being there!

00:17:53.640 --> 00:17:55.850
I was truly happy, too.

00:17:56.610 --> 00:17:58.510
This time, I'll always be by your side...

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:00.250
as Sophia.

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:05.370
Goodbye, and thank you,

00:18:05.370 --> 00:18:07.520
my precious best friend.

00:18:15.970 --> 00:18:18.020
Don't cry, Sophia.

00:18:19.940 --> 00:18:20.990
Good morning.

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:27.710
Welcome back, Lady Catarina!

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:29.410
Lady Catarina!

00:18:29.410 --> 00:18:31.920
I was so, so worried about you!

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:38.100
<i>This is my world.</i>

00:18:38.100 --> 00:18:41.710
<i>I want to protect this world 
and the people I care about.</i>

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:44.050
<i>I won't let that bad ending happen!</i>

00:18:44.490 --> 00:18:46.730
I'm going to save Maria!

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:47.650
Huh?

00:18:47.650 --> 00:18:51.310
Catarina, we still don't 
know where she's gone.

00:18:51.310 --> 00:18:53.650
She's on the school grounds,

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:55.360
in a hidden room in the storehouse.

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:58.000
What are you saying?

00:18:58.000 --> 00:18:59.940
How do you know where she is?

00:18:59.940 --> 00:19:02.410
Oh, uh...

00:19:02.880 --> 00:19:04.320
It came to me in a dream!

00:19:04.520 --> 00:19:05.720
Huh?

00:19:07.690 --> 00:19:10.960
The student council president 
was the one who cast the sleep spell on me.

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:12.910
He took Maria away, too.

00:19:12.910 --> 00:19:15.730
Sirius Dieke? It was him?

00:19:15.870 --> 00:19:17.420
Why would Sirius do that?

00:19:17.810 --> 00:19:19.980
He's where Maria is.

00:19:19.980 --> 00:19:21.410
Maria is safe.

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:23.410
Did that come to you in a dream, too?

00:19:23.410 --> 00:19:24.560
No.

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:27.140
It's my intuition!

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:35.940
I can't believe the president has magic 
that can manipulate people.

00:19:35.940 --> 00:19:39.780
I thought he was such a kind person... Why?

00:19:39.780 --> 00:19:42.530
I'm honestly not sure, either.

00:19:44.590 --> 00:19:45.620
That's it.

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:48.160
The Dieke family built the storehouse,

00:19:48.160 --> 00:19:50.380
but it's supposed to be essentially unused now.

00:19:57.320 --> 00:19:59.070
There really is a hidden room...

00:20:02.460 --> 00:20:03.570
Maria!

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:06.070
Lady Catarina... and everyone!

00:20:08.810 --> 00:20:11.280
I'm sorry we took so long, Maria!

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:16.130
I should apologize for putting 
you all through so much trouble.

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:19.690
No, don't apologize. 
I know you did it for my sake.

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:21.310
Thank you, Maria.

00:20:21.920 --> 00:20:24.860
So... what about the president? 
Is he still here?

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:26.340
Yes.

00:20:26.340 --> 00:20:30.370
Are you already aware of what he's done?

00:20:30.760 --> 00:20:32.390
I know the gist of it,

00:20:32.390 --> 00:20:35.200
but there's lot I don't understand about it.

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:38.120
That's why I want to talk 
to him one more time.

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:50.570
You know, the tea you make...

00:20:50.570 --> 00:20:52.430
has a very gentle flavor.

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:57.100
The tea you make has such a gentle flavor.

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:00.450
<i>I sense a human presence.</i>

00:21:00.800 --> 00:21:03.470
<i>You must not be caught here!</i>

00:21:03.470 --> 00:21:05.070
It's over.

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:06.830
The moment of my doom has come!

00:21:06.980 --> 00:21:08.180
<i>Not yet!</i>

00:21:08.180 --> 00:21:10.040
<i>You have not completed your revenge yet!</i>

00:21:10.380 --> 00:21:13.070
<i>Have you forgotten the last 
words your mother said to you?!</i>

00:21:14.200 --> 00:21:16.370
Mom! Mom!

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:19.920
Please... avenge me.

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:22.430
<i>Eliminate them all...</i>

00:21:22.430 --> 00:21:24.440
<i>using your dark magic.</i>

00:21:24.440 --> 00:21:26.880
No! If I do that...

00:21:39.560 --> 00:21:41.290
Are you okay, Maria?

00:21:41.290 --> 00:21:44.110
Yes... I sense incredible power.

00:21:58.720 --> 00:22:00.430
Sirius Dieke!

00:22:06.600 --> 00:22:07.580
You?

00:22:07.900 --> 00:22:09.500
What are you doing here?
